{% extends "layout.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<div class="wrap prose-page">
  <section class="page-intro">
    <h1 class="page-title">Shipping &amp; returns</h1>
    <p class="sub">Made-to-order timelines and delivery across India.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="prose-card">
    <h2>Print &amp; dispatch time</h2>
    <p>
      Every piece is printed after you place your order. Most unpainted prints ship in 2–4 days; hand-painted and weathered pieces take 5–7 days depending on drying and clear-coat curing.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="prose-card">
    <h2>Shipping rates (provisional)</h2>
    <p>
      Orders ship across India via tracked courier. Currently configured with a provisional flat rate of {{ store.flatShippingFormatted }} (free above {{ store.freeShippingThresholdFormatted }}) while final courier tiers are being locked in.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="prose-card">
    <h2>Returns &amp; transit damage</h2>
    <p>
      Final returns policy for made-to-order pieces is being finalized. If a print arrives cracked or damaged in transit, reach out within 48 hours with a photo so I can fix or reprint it.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
